    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"quiet\" period though. it's like the well has actually run dry and it's never coming back. i look at my work and i don't see anything worth saving. it feels like i've already finished my story, and now i'm just... lingering. does that even make sense? like a book that's already reached its conclusion but the pages keep turning for no reason.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
